Third-party software: tree-sitter and grammars

The WebAssembly modules in the language packages embed the tree-sitter runtime,
one grammar with its scanner, the highlight queries of each grammar, and the shim
in shim/shim.c. internal/grammarbuild builds them from the pinned commits below.
